(in-ns 'go.arbace.hs) ^{:go/comments [[3 1 "// The machine's API to the compiled code (HE8, aot.go): the generated packages (arbace/aot/UNIT_MODULE, one per Haskell"] [4 1 "// module) are outside package hs, so a library module's package is compiled once by Go's build cache and linked into every"] [5 1 "// program that needs it. Small functions: Go's compiler inlines them across the packages."] [7 1 "// GoCode is compiled code: a Go function of the frame, and the node tree it was generated from (the collector's)."] [10 1 "// NewGoCode is compiled code for fn generated from orig."] [15 1 "// AOTRegister registers a closure's installer by \"UNIT:MODULE NAME\" and its tree's shape."] [20 1 "// Eval evaluates a node (the interpreter's code for what the generator leaves to it)."] [62 1 "// Pure is a pure primop's value on the arguments in the machine's buffer (PrimE.simple's)."] [70 1 "// InstallLam puts compiled code in a let's i-th closure's body."] [76 1 "// InstallJoin puts compiled code in the jump's join point's body and returns it."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis []} (go/file "aotapi.go" :imports [])

;; The machine's API to the compiled code (HE8, aot.go): the generated packages (arbace/aot/UNIT_MODULE, one per Haskell
;; module) are outside package hs, so a library module's package is compiled once by Go's build cache and linked into every
;; program that needs it. Small functions: Go's compiler inlines them across the packages.


